  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Bilateral Development Programme 2024-2028: Strategic Objective 1: Adaptation to Climate Change &amp; Green Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to reduce poverty by strengthening the climate resilience of vulnerable communities in Somaliland. The objective will be reached by increasing the climate resilience of water resources and food systems, strengthening resilience among vulnerable groups through new economic and employment opportunities, and increasing private investment into green, environmentally-friendly, and climate-smart solutions. The Fund will work directly with the government of Somaliland.</narrative>
  </description>
